  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Umbrella Facility Poverty Equality IE 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Umbrella Facility for Poverty and Equity (UFPE) works to build an evidence base to inform development policies and programmes so that they can be more effective in reducing poverty and promoting equity. It is the first global facility with this cross-cutting thematic focus. The UFPE supports the generation of relevant data and the strengthening of national data systems as a foundation for high-quality analysis and advice. This is intended to inform decision-makers and the design, implementation and evaluation of policies and programmes so that they better serve these dual objectives on poverty and equity.</narrative>
  </description>
